HAIStack research artefacts
==========================

Code under research/ is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
See the repository root LICENSE file.

Datasets, corpora, gold ConceptMaps, workload definitions, and synthetic FHIR
instances under research/ are original, fully synthetic, and contain no PHI.
They are also licensed under Apache License 2.0 so that code and data can be
redistributed together.

If a future dataset uses a different license (for example CC-BY for a
third-party synthetic corpus), that dataset directory will include its own
LICENSE file. None of the artefacts in this tree currently differ from
Apache 2.0.
